 ## Background
-DVGO was introduced by Sun et al. in CVPR 2022 [S1, unofficial]. It builds on the idea of differentiable volume rendering but replaces the neural network representation with direct voxel grids. The method was developed to address the slow training times of NeRF. It is used in various datasets including NeRF Synthetic, NSVF, BlendedMVS, Tanks and Temples, DeepVoxels, and LLFF [S1, unofficial].
